{"arDan napunsakam‌": [{"id": "arDaM napuMsakam‌", "headword": "अर्धं नपुंसकम्‌", "headword_slp1": "arDaM napuMsakam‌", "fold": "arDan napunsakam‌", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The word अर्द्ध when it signifies exactly equal parts i.e. halves, is always neuter and is compounded with a word signifying a thing that has parts, provided that the thing halved is numerically one; and the compound is तत्-पुरुष।\n\nTerms: समास-तत्-पुरुष", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["अर्धं नपुंसकम्‌ २.२.२", "२.२.२", "२.२.२ अर्धं नपुंसकम्‌"], "synonyms_slp1": ["arDaM napuMsakam‌ २.२.२", "२.२.२", "२.२.२ arDaM napuMsakam‌"]}], "arDarcaH punsi ca": [{"id": "arDarcAH puMsi ca", "headword": "अर्धर्चाः पुंसि च", "headword_slp1": "arDarcAH puMsi ca", "fold": "arDarcaH punsi ca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The words अर्धर्च etc. are spoken of in masculine and neuter.\n\nTerms: समास-gender", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["अर्धर्चाः पुंसि च २.४.३१", "२.४.३१", "२.४.३१ अर्धर्चाः पुंसि च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["arDarcAH puMsi ca २.४.३१", "२.४.३१", "२.४.३१ arDarcAH puMsi ca"]}], "arDadyat‌": [{"id": "arDAdyat‌", "headword": "अर्धाद्यत्‌", "headword_slp1": "arDAdyat‌", "fold": "arDadyat‌", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix यत् comes after the word अर्द्ध in the remaining senses.\n\nTerms: यत्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["अर्धाद्यत्‌ ४.३.४", "४.३.४", "४.३.४ अर्धाद्यत्‌"], "synonyms_slp1": ["arDAdyat‌ ४.३.४", "४.३.४", "४.३.४ arDAdyat‌"]}], "arDaca": [{"id": "arDAcca", "headword": "अर्धाच्च", "headword_slp1": "arDAcca", "fold": "arDaca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix टच् comes after the word नौ when preceded by the word अर्ध in a तत्-पुरुष समास ।\n\nTerms: टच्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["अर्धाच्च ५.४.१००", "५.४.१००", "५.४.१०० अर्धाच्च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["arDAcca ५.४.१००", "५.४.१००", "५.४.१०० arDAcca"]}], "arDaDatuke": [{"id": "ArDaDAtuke", "headword": "आर्धधातुके", "headword_slp1": "ArDaDAtuke", "fold": "arDaDatuke", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "From this up to युप्लुवोर्दीर्घश्छन्दसि ६.४.६८, inclusive, is always to be supplied the words ' before an affix called आर्धधातुक -- आर्द्धधातुकं शेषः ३.४.११४ etc.'\n\nTerms: आर्धधातुक changes", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["आर्धधातुके ६.४.४६", "६.४.४६", "६.४.४६ आर्धधातुके"], "synonyms_slp1": ["ArDaDAtuke ६.४.४६", "६.४.४६", "६.४.४६ ArDaDAtuke"]}], "arDaDatukasyeq valadeH": [{"id": "ArDaDAtukasyeq valAdeH", "headword": "आर्धधातुकस्येड् वलादेः", "headword_slp1": "ArDaDAtukasyeq valAdeH", "fold": "arDaDatukasyeq valadeH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "An आर्धधातुक affix -- आर्द्धधातुकं शेषः ३.४.११४ etc., beginning with a consonant (except य) gets the augment इट् (in these rules).\n\nTerms: इट् augment", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["आर्धधातुकस्येड् वलादेः ७.२.३५", "७.२.३५", "७.२.३५ आर्धधातुकस्येड् वलादेः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["ArDaDAtukasyeq valAdeH ७.२.३५", "७.२.३५", "७.२.३५ ArDaDAtukasyeq valAdeH"]}], "arDat‌ parimaRasya purvasya tu va": [{"id": "arDAt‌ parimARasya pUrvasya tu vA", "headword": "अर्धात्‌ परिमाणस्य पूर्वस्य तु वा", "headword_slp1": "arDAt‌ parimARasya pUrvasya tu vA", "fold": "arDat‌ parimaRasya purvasya tu va", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "Before a तद्धित affix having an indicatory ञ् , ण् or क् the वृद्धि is substituted for the first vowel of the second member, denoting a mass in its widest sense when the word अर्ध precedes it, but optionally for the first vowel of अर्ध।\n\nTerms: वृद्धि", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["अर्धात्‌ परिमाणस्य पूर्वस्य तु वा ७.३.२६", "७.३.२६", "७.३.२६ अर्धात्‌ परिमाणस्य पूर्वस्य तु वा"], "synonyms_slp1": ["arDAt‌ parimARasya pUrvasy